;sequence

The sequences of 13F6-1-2 Fab fragment heavy 
chain and light chain did not exist in UNP 
database at the time of processing.

The synthetic Envelope glycoprotein peptide 
naturally exists in Zaire Ebolavirus as 
residues 404-414.
